# ── SECRETS — never commit ─────────────────────────────────────
# SERVIO_CREDENTIALS.txt holds DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET, ADMIN_SECRET_KEY,
# per-client API keys and the manager/cashier PINs.
SERVIO_CREDENTIALS.txt
*CREDENTIALS*
.env
