# Per-client fiches/licences (clients/<Name>/FICHE_CLIENT.txt,
# clients/<Name>/LICENCE_<NAME>.txt) — each one has that client's real
# dashboard password, PINs, API key, and the shared Servio admin key in
# plaintext. Both repos this project lives in are public GitHub repos —
# these must only ever exist on this machine.
FICHE_CLIENT*.txt
LICENCE_*.txt
LICENSE_*.txt

